title: The Mimic Shelf
portrait left: seeker

You notice a shelf that is... too neat. Too uniform. All the books are the same color, perfectly lined up.
Something is tucked behind the books, but the shelf appears to be... breathing?

choice:
  - Reach behind the books -> reach
  - Leave the shelf alone -> leave

@reach
  > fight mossback-beetle,page-wisp,page-wisp reward:double
  The shelf bites down, crushing the books and the dead beetle, but luckily not your hand.
  > end

@leave
  You know better than to test a 'living shelf'. The shelf exhales.
  > end
